      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so its getting kind of worse. my calf is turning a bit reddish/purple now and it feels really tight like it's gonna pop. i'm really scared it's a clot but i literally cannot afford an ER visit right now. is there any way i can just take some high dose something or do like a specific massage or something to break the clot up so i don't have to go to the hospital? i just need to fix this myself.",
