    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stretches? won't that make it worse if there's a clot in there? i'm worried i'll move it and it'll go to my lungs or something. my friend mentioned that if you do deep tissue massage on the area you can sometimes break up the blockage and get the blood flowing again... is that actually safe to try if i'm careful? i just really need this gone without a doctor.",
